/**
 * Teaser word-burst faces, base64 TTF. Embedded for the same reason as the
 * other faces in ../fonts-*-data.ts: headless Chrome has no network font
 * access, so a linked font would silently fall back to a system sans.
 *
 *   Poppins  — Light / LightItalic / Regular / Italic / Medium / SemiBold
 *   Literata — variable [opsz,wght], upright + italic
 *
 * Source: github.com/google/fonts (OFL).
 */

